### 8.1 Input Edge Cases
- **Gamepad disconnect:** Fallback to keyboard input seamlessly
- **Rapid fire spam:** Cooldown timer prevents bullet spam abuse
- **Boundary violation:** Clamp player position, bounce off walls

### 8.2 Collision Edge Cases
- **Bullet passing through:** Sub-stepping at high velocities (fixed timestep)
- **Simultaneous multi-hit:** Process one hit per frame to prevent score exploits
- **Shield penetration:** Shield absorbs first shot, then breaks permanently

### 8.3 Performance Edge Cases
- **Low-end devices:** Fallback bloom strength to 0.8, reduce particle count to 250
- **Memory pressure:** Auto-pool cleanup if heap exceeds 100MB
- **Browser tab inactive:** Pause game loop to save battery

